  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then came the first falling star, a line of flame rushing east over Winchester.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.94
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I was writing in my study, the blind up, and I never once looked up.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.5,
      "seconds": 4.68
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Ogilvy had seen it fall. At dawn he went hunting it on Horsell Common.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 13.208,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Sand was flung over the heath in heaps, and eastward the heather burned.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 19.208,
      "seconds": 5.22
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The Thing lay half-buried in a great pit: a cylinder thirty yards across.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 25.458,
      "seconds": 5.8
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ogilvy",
      "text": "Good Lord. No meteorite was ever that shape.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 32.292,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He clambered down into the heat. The ash was falling from the end alone.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 42.292,
      "seconds": 4.7
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Very slowly, the circular top was turning. Something inside was unscrewing it.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 48.0,
      "seconds": 6.84
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ogilvy",
      "text": "Good heavens! A man in it, half roasted!",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 56.167,
      "seconds": 4.26
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He forgot the heat and went to help turn it. The glowing metal drove him back.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 61.75,
      "seconds": 5.8
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He ran for Woking, hatless and wild. It was six o'clock.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 68.583,
      "seconds": 4.67
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A waggoner simply drove on. At Horsell Bridge, a potman tried to lock him in.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 74.292,
      "seconds": 5.78
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then he saw Henderson, the London journalist, digging in his garden.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 81.083,
      "seconds": 5.14
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ogilvy",
      "text": "Henderson! That shooting star: it is out on Horsell Common!",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 87.25,
      "seconds": 5.98
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "henderson",
      "text": "Good Lord! A fallen meteorite! That is good.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 94.25,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ogilvy",
      "text": "It is an artificial cylinder, man!",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 99.542,
      "seconds": 4.31
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "henderson",
      "text": "What is that?",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 105.375,
      "seconds": 1.79
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He was deaf in one ear.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 107.865,
      "seconds": 2.11
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The two hurried back. The sounds inside had stopped. They rapped the crust with a stick.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 111.375,
      "seconds": 5.9
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A thin ring of bright metal showed at the rim, and air hissed through it.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 118.292,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "By eight, boys and idle men were off to see the dead men from Mars.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 125.083,
      "seconds": 5.06
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "My newspaper boy told me at a quarter to nine. I lost no time.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 131.167,
      "seconds": 5.2
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_newspaper_boy",
      "text": "Dead men from Mars, sir! Out at the sand-pits!",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 137.875,
      "seconds": 3.48
    }
  ]
}